{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/993562-sidestep","id":993562,"title":"Sidestep","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-26T10:22:02-07:00","id":993562,"title":"Sidestep","content":"Can werewolves use sidestepping during combat to escape by the end of the turn? and can they do that with only 1 success (precisely a wp spent)? thanks in advance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12133-leonardo","name":"Leonardo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"116"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-26T10:36:09-07:00","id":993571,"title":"","content":"This is clearly covered by the rules; are you running a crossover and are unfamiliar with WtA? Yes, a Garou can slip sideways instantly, but they need three successes to do so at the difficulty rating of the local Gauntlet. Stepping sideways with a single success will take five minutes, i.e; forever in combat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-26T13:44:51-07:00","id":993673,"title":"","content":"However, there are more expanded rules in <b>WoD:Combat.</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It takes a combat turn to step sideways, and during that time the character(s) attempt to enter the spirit realm may not move, fight, or dodge; attacks against them are at +2 Accuracy. Furthermore, in an attack disturbs or breakes the shiny surface the character is using to enter the spirit realm, the attempt is thwarted.<br /> A character who is trapped in the Gauntlet for a period of time as she enters the spirit realm is still physical vulnerable. He cannot move, attack or take any physical actions; attacks against him are at +2 Accuracy. However, because he is only part physical at that point, attacks against him are at -3 Damage. Attacks from magick or other powers that affect the spirit as well as the body do full damage. </div> </div> </div>Accuracy is additional die to attack role, Damage is dice pool modifier to damage rolls; within the system of WoD:Combat.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-26T16:55:59-07:00","id":993777,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>heinrich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/993562-sidestep?p=993673#post993673\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">However, there are more expanded rules in <b>WoD:Combat.</b><br /> <br /> <br /> Accuracy is additional die to attack role, Damage is dice pool modifier to damage rolls; within the system of WoD:Combat.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Then again, WoD: Combat also has you using Dodge to block and Melee for bows and arrows... and its interpretation of Fenris's Bite is rather underpowered.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T17:29:47-07:00","id":994295,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Laughing Stranger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/993562-sidestep?p=993571#post993571\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is clearly covered by the rules; are you running a crossover and are unfamiliar with WtA? Yes, a Garou can slip sideways instantly, but they need three successes to do so at the difficulty rating of the local Gauntlet. Stepping sideways with a single success will take five minutes, i.e; forever in combat.</div> </div> </div> </div>This, is the best.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12443-daddyindabasement","name":"DaddyInDaBasement","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12443_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}